  "fullDescription": "Start Up is a Retro Pixel typeface. It comes in 2 styles, regular and bubble. Inspired by retro games, Start Up feels playfully nostalgic and delivers an incredible vintage retro aesthetic. This font is perfect for almost every project that needs a retro touch like labels, packaging, craft, book covers, posters, merchandise, branding, stickers, games UI, and much more. Use this display font to add that special retro touch to any design idea you can think of!",
